Date: Mon, 13 Jul 2026 21:13:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 162/638] net: record AROS QUIC resolver integration [chromium]
 [aros]

Statement: The Chromium superproject must pin the QUICHE revision that routes hostname lookup through the task-local AROSTCP boundary.

Evidence: QUICHE commit f902632 compiles quic_name_lookup.o against the AROS SDK after the upstream POSIX resolver calls failed.

Validation: ninja -C out/aros-windowed -j48 obj/net/third_party/quiche/quiche_tool_support/quic_name_lookup.o

Chain:; ACD-chromium-aros-network-substrate
---
 net/third_party/quiche/src | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/net/third_party/quiche/src b/net/third_party/quiche/src
index 9f8738892e..f9026320eb 160000
--- a/net/third_party/quiche/src
+++ b/net/third_party/quiche/src
@@ -1 +1 @@
-Subproject commit 9f8738892edd83219d2f83fdd73c7c14d5dbb80d
+Subproject commit f9026320ebcc11d705e302c3ea10caece1f8ee63
